    icon: 'ph-duotone ph-code',
    technologies: [
      'HTML',
      'CSS',
      'JavaScript',
      'React',
      'TypeScript',
      'Next.js',
    ],
  },

  {
    number: '02',
    title: 'Solution Architecture',
    description:
      'I faced major challenges and entered a completely new world, one that changed the way I build software and choose technologies. At first, architecture felt like a big puzzle. Today, I understand that what matters most is seeing the whole picture, understanding how each part connects, and putting the pieces together with purpose.',
    icon: 'ph-duotone ph-angle',
    technologies: [
      'Frontend Architecture',
      'REST APIs',
      'PostgreSQL',
      'Docker',
      'CI/CD',
      'OWASP',
    ],
  },

  {
    number: '04',
    title: 'Neuroscience & Behavior',
    description:
      'Neuroscience has been a dream of mine since I was nine years old. Years later, it became part of my education and the way I understand people and technology. Today, connecting neuroscience, software, and AI feels like bringing together ideas that have been part of my life for a long time.',
    icon: 'ph-duotone ph-brain',
    technologies: [
      'Neuroscience',
      'Behavior',
      'Cognition',
      'Human-centered Design',
      'AI',
    ],
  },

  {
    number: '05',
    title: 'Next Steps',
    description:
      'My next steps are focused on expanding my technical skills. I want to go deeper into security, improve my Python skills, and continue building AKTIV+, connecting frontend, backend, AI, and neuroscience in a real product.',
    icon: 'ph-duotone ph-steps',
    technologies: [
      'Python',
      'AI',
      'Backend',
      'Web Security',
      'AKTIV+',
    ],
  },
